{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finally, a tactical RPG that has NO RNG to Hit, Miss, or Crit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.poster.avif?t=1757108118\" width=418 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.webm?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.mp4?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you attack, use an item, cast a spell, or defend yourself, you'll face a Ring Trial. Click when the indicator is in the Blue Zone to succeed. Click when the indicator is in the Red Zone for a critical success! But, of course, try not to miss...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A living battlefield to change as you please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.poster.avif?t=1757108118\" width=418 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.webm?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.mp4?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain has a massive impact on battles. Fortunately, you can change it freely with your magic! Just beware... your foes can do the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story that changes based on how you fight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions speak louder than words. There's no dialogue trees of  options for you here... how your characters interact depends on how you fight. Your decisions (and your skill) will determine your party's fate\u2014in more ways than one! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The party that never stops!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the new king sent princess Sahana to the far-flung hinterlands of the kingdom via a &quot;political marriage,&quot; she didn't expect a warm welcome. And that's great, because she didn't get one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her reluctant husband, Kadi, treats her well but mostly avoids her. Vexingly, he does not seem to be avoiding a beautiful mercenary named Celestora\u2014who says she wants Kadi dead, but spends all her time with him anyway. Hana's &quot;exile&quot; isn't the worst, but she has had about enough of this little situation... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this band of misfits as they venture to quell the monsters that trouble the province...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Indie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radix Chronicle is brought to you by the 2 person studio, Luna Flora. Ray handles the code, and Marcus handles the other stuff!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Optional Mission 1: Don't Miss a Ring Trial!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/8714684baf311f178def9c0af99f22c6d604d968.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 2: Shock the Shaman!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/2c257046d45b662dba0a11d7116d6a3a190f4350.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 3: Protect the Princess!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/bd90f4cd2bc1533c97f147729af766b1aa00d076.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 4: Keep Your Feet Dry!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/f9598c46deb871122b422af64ec654f2855eb21f.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 5: Settle Down!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/312a3d4c414e437dc425caa0d6ccc86e64b655c2.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Mission 1: Roast Duck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/464733dfb8a6b8523af0a0273f762df8d5dec16b.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 6: Dirty Girl! Dirty! Dirty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/c603f5bf660aeb245d10e90b51707d76198b003e.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 7: Survive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/2f4a5893ce94db4ad51e33f1fa6497ee39778e82.jpg"},{"name":"Optional Mission 8: Don't Get Canceled!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/dfc08746e53381b8d6cda7e6f0d3848a75b9c681.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Mission 2: Cancel the Witch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2430540/128c26112a409f3dea8d119e81e19471299488f5.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2430540?t=1757108118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757108118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/16d430759613559520278be4a4d189180d28d10b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757108118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/16d430759613559520278be4a4d189180d28d10b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757108118","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Radix Chronicle, despite its light-hearted appearance, does touch on mature topics and situations. While the visuals are bright, some aspects of the setting and story have a darker tone. \r\n\r\nFurthermore, it is a game that requires a degree of patience and flexible thinking. It is not intended for children."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Finally, a tactical RPG that has NO RNG to Hit, Miss, or Crit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.poster.avif?t=1757108118\" width=418 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.webm?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/4c3bf85c5806e71257b6a76a28798178.mp4?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you attack, use an item, cast a spell, or defend yourself, you'll face a Ring Trial. Click when the indicator is in the Blue Zone to succeed. Click when the indicator is in the Red Zone for a critical success! But, of course, try not to miss...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A living battlefield to change as you please!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.poster.avif?t=1757108118\" width=418 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.webm?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/extras/26de1a7ccb7dca85bbcc28180aa86b9e.mp4?t=1757108118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain has a massive impact on battles. Fortunately, you can change it freely with your magic! Just beware... your foes can do the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A story that changes based on how you fight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions speak louder than words. There's no dialogue trees of  options for you here... how your characters interact depends on how you fight. Your decisions (and your skill) will determine your party's fate\u2014in more ways than one! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The party that never stops!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the new king sent princess Sahana to the far-flung hinterlands of the kingdom via a &quot;political marriage,&quot; she didn't expect a warm welcome. And that's great, because she didn't get one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her reluctant husband, Kadi, treats her well but mostly avoids her. Vexingly, he does not seem to be avoiding a beautiful mercenary named Celestora\u2014who says she wants Kadi dead, but spends all her time with him anyway. Hana's &quot;exile&quot; isn't the worst, but she has had about enough of this little situation... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this band of misfits as they venture to quell the monsters that trouble the province...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Indie</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Radix Chronicle is brought to you by the 2 person studio, Luna Flora. Ray handles the code, and Marcus handles the other stuff!</p>","developers":["Luna Flora"],"dlc":[3894030,3894040],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/b625b92fbd44e5a45dbb750e907c2ea28d064350/header.jpg?t=1757108118","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB of memory, shader model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB of memory, shader model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15.5.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB of memory, shader model 2.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 15.5.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or