6257326db70316e22d8755ed6ede.600x338.jpg?t=1757108118"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/05b95e84be93d568bd74272bec2e96e56e8a00de/ss_05b95e84be93d568bd74272bec2e96e56e8a00de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757108118","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/05b95e84be93d568bd74272bec2e96e56e8a00de/ss_05b95e84be93d568bd74272bec2e96e56e8a00de.600x338.jpg?t=1757108118"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/82cf54439577936a318381edc1cf9a9c0be257b5/ss_82cf54439577936a318381edc1cf9a9c0be257b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757108118","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/82cf54439577936a318381edc1cf9a9c0be257b5/ss_82cf54439577936a318381edc1cf9a9c0be257b5.600x338.jpg?t=1757108118"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/2cbd2ecec37eb55b937769df83aa4d0e5742724d/ss_2cbd2ecec37eb55b937769df83aa4d0e5742724d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757108118","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/2cbd2ecec37eb55b937769df83aa4d0e5742724d/ss_2cbd2ecec37eb55b937769df83aa4d0e5742724d.600x338.jpg?t=1757108118"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/2026f234709f66ccb143e58f240599d75f715bc9/ss_2026f234709f66ccb143e58f240599d75f715bc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757108118","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430540/2026f234709f66ccb143e58f240599d75f715bc9/ss_2026f234709f66ccb143e58f240599d75f715bc9.600x338.jpg?t=1757108118"}],"short_description":"Radix is a tactical RPG inspired by SNES and Playstation classics. With dark themes but bright characters, this fantasy tale changes depending on how you fight! Your magic can even alter the land itself. Use your timing and skill, rather than your luck, to lead your party home safely each day!","steam_appid":2430540,"support_info":{"email":"support@lunaflora.studio","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}